now to another effort to help las vegas  in need delivering with dignity is  looking for volunteers right now ahead  of the holiday season  joining us is casey noble coordinator  with the program  thanks so much for joining us casey  first off tell us what delivery with  dignity is and how it was created  yes so delivering with dignity is a  covered response initiative  that was started back in march of this  year at the request  of county commissioner marilyn  kirkpatrick  what we're able to do is provide  restaurant quality prepared meals  to the clients that we serve the goal  was to keep our  vulnerable individuals and families at  home  while keeping the rest of the community  safe in addition to that we've been able  to support our independently owned  restaurant partners by  keeping 57 of their restaurant workers  employed this year wow that is  considerable and  i bet the need is so great this year  what do you need right now  to keep the organization going and so  you can help these families  so our volunteer food heroes are the  life of our organization since march  they have helped us safely deliver  nearly 250 000 meals across the valley  five days a week we deliver to about 200  households a day  meeting on average 30 volunteers a day  we saw an amazing turnout during the  week of thanksgiving  next week the need is going to be just  as high  as we approach the new year that needs  only going to continue as well  in addition to volunteers donations help  to keep our program running  this program was intended to be a  short-term program but  as the need has continued to increase as  a result  of the vulnerable members of our  community continuing to stay at home  now if one of our viewers needs  assistance how can they qualify casey  to qualify for our program you have to  meet our triple threat most vulnerable  criteria  what that means is you are at the  highest risk of exposure to covid per  the cdc guidelines  you may not have access to resources  whether that be your family  friends a church or another non-profit  here in town  and additionally you don't have the  financial means to provide meals for  yourself  the more information can be found at our  deliveringwithdignitylv.org website  where viewers can inquire and submit a  contact form to see if they qualify  casey thank you so much for your efforts  and your time today  i know you said you started in march you  didn't know it would last this long but  of course it will be continuing  into the new year and um thank you again  for all you do  and the efforts thank you and have a  safe holiday thank you as well
 

